    "body": "In gecko we solved this by actually having a bool to run the abort loop in the beginning of `#fire-a-push/replace/reload-navigate-event`, but if we in #11579 move the abort loop to `#inform-the-navigation-api-about-aborting-navigation`, then we could call that in `#reload` , before calling #fire-a-push/replace/reload-navigate-event, even though `#fire-a-push/replace/reload-navigate-event` would do that in case of same document.",
